# Normalise line endings on the way into the repository and check everything
# out as LF, on every platform.
#
# Without this, GitHub's Windows runners check out CRLF (core.autocrlf=true is
# their default) and `prettier --check` — whose endOfLine defaults to "lf" —
# rejects every file in the repo before the tests ever run. The CI failure it
# produces says nothing about the code.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Golden transcripts are byte-compared against captured output, so they must
# never be touched by normalisation.
test/transcripts/*.txt -text
